flowchart TD
    A[Client uploads image] --> B[Validate metadata and binary signature]
    B --> C{Valid image?}

    C -- No --> D[Return 400 ProblemDetails]
    C -- Yes --> E[Read image bytes]

    E --> F[Send image to Python OCR service]
    F --> G{OCR successful?}

    G -- No --> H[Return OCR ProblemDetails]
    G -- Yes --> I[Store original image]

    I --> J{Storage successful?}
    J -- No --> K[Return image_storage_failed]
    J -- Yes --> L[Create Images entity]

    L --> M[Create ordered OcrLines entities]
    M --> N[Save aggregate with EF Core]

    N --> O{Persistence successful?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Commit SQLite transaction]
    P --> Q[Return image metadata and raw OCR]

    O -- No --> R[Translate database exception]
    R --> S[Attempt to delete stored image]
    S --> T[Log cleanup failure when necessary]
    T --> U[Return ocr_persistence_failed]